Intersecting filters | CALCULATE modifies context. KEEPFILTERS intersects with existing same-column filters rather than replacing them, which can leave an empty intersection. | CALCULATE; KEEPFILTERS; Context | Bike Revenue = CALCULATE([Revenue],KEEPFILTERS(Product[Category]="Bike")) | A Car-only context has no matching Bike sales. | Category KPIs remain honest under slicers. | Remove KEEPFILTERS and compare under Car selection.
